    <h2>The service</h2>
    <p>Evo Meals is a school meal management platform connecting parents, students, schools, and catering partners. It lets parents book and pay for their child's meals, lets school administrators see program activity for their own school, and lets schools and caterers get in touch about partnering with us.</p>

    <h2>Accounts</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>You're responsible for keeping your login credentials secure and for activity that happens under your account.</li>
      <li>Parent accounts are for managing your own children's bookings, meals, and wallet — not for other families.</li>
      <li>School admin accounts are provisioned for a specific school and are scoped to that school's own data only.</li>
      <li>Information you provide — including a student's allergy details — should be accurate and kept up to date, since it's used to prepare meals safely.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Wallet, bookings, and payments</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Wallet top-ups are held as credit against future meal bookings.</li>
      <li>Cancelling an eligible booking refunds the corresponding amount to your wallet, subject to the cancellation window shown at the time of booking.</li>
      <li>Monthly subscriptions run for a fixed number of school days from the start date and can be renewed manually before they end.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
    <p>You agree not to misuse the platform — including attempting to access another family's or another school's data, submitting false allergy or safety information, or using the partnership inquiry forms for anything other than a genuine school or catering inquiry.</p>

    <h2>Catering and school partners</h2>
    <p>Submitting a partnership inquiry through our Schools or Caterers pages does not on its own create a contractual relationship. It starts a conversation — any partnership, onboarding, or data-sharing arrangement is confirmed separately in writing.</p>

    <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
    <p>We may update these terms as the platform evolves. Material changes will be reflected here with an updated date.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about these terms can be sent through our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>, or by email to <strong>legal@evomeals.demo</strong>.</p>

    <p class="legal-note">Evo Meals is presented here as a product demonstration. These terms describe how the platform is designed to operate in production use.</p>

